{"id": "De4Mt6KtZAH", "title": "Video by toaidanh_", "description": "“I was going to tell Dad once I found a job.”\n\nBy day, he wears a suit to interviews. By night, he delivers food to pay the rent. He hides it from his father, afraid that after all those years of support, he’ll let him down.\n\nBut his father simply stops him from taking off the delivery jacket: “Keep it on. I know how hard you’re trying.”\n\nHave you ever been afraid to go home because you haven’t become the person your family hoped you’d be?\n\n🎬 LIFE’S BURDENS — A show by ToaiDanh\n\nComing soon to @showrunner.tv 🎬✨\n\n#LifesBurdens #YoungAdults #LifePressure #FatherAndSon #AnimatedShortFilm", "channel": "toaidanh_", "uploader_id": "46613229241", "uploader": "Danhtoai", "timestamp": 1792847252, "like_count": 717, "comment_count": 51, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1130173736170016a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 79.001, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNWoEQEvU7ElMPDP25I8vyMIN9fFbc0w_SATD6Qhs8vpNJjnE-lYYdxzhOUHvRf8ixlaRBIALey3YbKc-aXQsce_X5y2F_KiBrPP9Q.mp4?_nc_cat=104&_nc_oc=Adp22RgO3jASbSCHNttVcfzwdslObBzElkKsg24RuYm_MxkxKwj8z402_qggi2rwWjD7wgkJFixY3pC7M3mA4Fq8&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=nTq_6ChWz54Q7kNvwE_-zb0&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=3LdV1bXKoIIcliwZXtpGyQ&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQQqhJ2r_gYy4JI55lasPwxLTAGOEFFhND0pO6iAk-VUBA&oe=6AF424AD", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 79.001, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Langu